## Research degrees of freedom

The previous version's archive holds {{ladder:research_degrees_of_freedom/leaderboard_entries|d}} leaderboard entries, {{ladder:research_degrees_of_freedom/leaderboard_entries_on_cohorts_naming_a_year_in_2017_2024|d}} of them on cohorts
naming a year in 2017–2024, and {{ladder:research_degrees_of_freedom/experiment_ledger_entries|d}} experiment-ledger entries
([data/registries](../data/registries)). Every entry is an exposed pass over
development data; nothing on disk is a holdout. The current version's passes are listed on
[CURRENT_2017_2025_RESULTS.md](benchmarks/CURRENT_2017_2025_RESULTS.md).
